ents/744/568/triggered-darkdeath.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"106\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>授權聲明 - 歡迎將本模組用於自製模組包</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>點擊下方橫幅立即租用伺服器！或前往<a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">BisectHosting.com</a>&nbsp;並務必使用代碼「<strong>gamerpotion</strong>」享75折優惠</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/608/745/bisect-banner-large3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"415\" /></a></p>",
